    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i guess it's just hard because it feels like a lot of these arguments against density are just people being NIMBYs and trying to stop progress. do you think it's fair to just frame their concerns as being against the city's growth? or is there a more \"correct\" way to look at it?",
